message: "If you use these analyses, the dashboard, or the derived data, please cite the project as below (restricted use — see LICENSE)."
title: "E9.5 Mouse Single-Cell Atlas of Spliceosome Mutants (Eftud2, Sf3b4) vs Control: Interactive Dashboard and Analysis Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Single-cell RNA-seq comparison of E9.5 mouse embryos across three
  conditions — wild-type Control and two craniofacial spliceosomopathy
  mutants (Eftud2 and Sf3b4), each pooling two biological replicates.
  The repository provides the R analysis pipelines, derived summary data
  and an interactive dashboard covering cell-type composition,
  differential expression (per cell type and pseudo-bulk), functional
  enrichment, splicing ratios and RNA velocity, for both the whole-embryo
  atlas (all cell types) and the neural-crest compartment (NCC sub-types).
